          "label": "Who planted this garden?",
          "about": "soil",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "q.today.who.answer",
              "text": "In our imagined garden, neighbours planted it together. Someone brought seedlings; someone carried water. Tomorrow, someone must come back to tend it.",
